<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower than Friday's close. Trading was moderately active. Top $51.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs    51.00-51.50</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs    50.50-51.00</p>
<p>Sows  - off $3.00/up $2.00. Top $58.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     300-450 lbs   few 43.00</p>
<p>		   450-500 lbs   few 46.00-48.00</p>
<p>		   500-650 lbs   few 56.00-58.00</p>
